            <text>3.1.1.2.T1 Welche Gleichungen sind linear [Which equations are linear]</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
