<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Which of the following are linear equations?
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Welche der Folgenden sind lineare Gleichungen?
    </span>
</p>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
